<title>USA: Sunrise Resources sees arbitration ruling in March.</title>
<headline>Sunrise Resources sees arbitration ruling in March.</headline>
<dateline>GOLDEN VALLEY, Minn. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunrise Resources Inc said it expects a decision in early March on the arbitration of claims related to its 1995 merger with International Leasing Corp.</p>
<p>Sunrise Resources is embroiled in a dispute with a major shareholder over the merger.</p>
<p>The company also said it expects to sign leasing agreements with two additional vendors in the near future and it is holding talks with other unidentified vendors.</p>
<p>Sunrise Resources offers vendor leasing programs to manufacturers and distributors.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
